<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ca">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Festa de Superherois</title>
    <style>
        table, th, td {
            border: 1px solid black;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Festa de Superherois</h1>
    <p>Llista de convidats a la gran festa de la Lliga dels Herois.</p>

    <table>
        <caption>Convidats de la festa</caption>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Convidat</th>
                <th>Menjar preferit</th>
                <th>Hora d'arribada</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Hulk</td>
                <td>Carn</td>
                <td>18:00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Spiderman</td>
                <td>Truita de patates</td>
                <td>18:00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Ant Man</td>
                <td>Espaguetis</td>
                <td>18:30</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Super Man</td>
                <td>Pizza</td>
                <td>18:30</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Wonder Women</td>
                <td>Patates Fregides</td>
                <td>19:00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Capitan America</td>
                <td>Paella</td>
                <td>19:00</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</body>

</html>
